{"id": "116", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The church bells ring out over the old gothic cathedral as a crowd murmurs in the distance, accompanied by the sound of rain and wind blowing into the microphone.", "pred": "The video shows a detailed view of an old gothic-style stone cathedral with large arched windows and a tall central tower, surrounded by a green lawn and a few bare trees, while bells are ringing in the background.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "The video shows a detailed view of an old gothic-style stone cathedral with large arched windows and a tall central tower, surrounded by a green lawn and a few bare trees, while bells are ringing in the background.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe video shows a detailed view of an old gothic-style stone cathedral with large arched windows and a tall central tower, surrounded by a green lawn and a few bare trees, while bells are ringing in the background.\nThe video captures the intricate architecture of a historic gothic cathedral, characterized by its massive stone walls, ornate windows, and prominent central spire, all set against a backdrop of a peaceful lawn and trees, with the intermittent sound of church bells resonating through the air.\nThe video depicts a gothic cathedral with elaborate architectural features such as arched windows, a tall tower, and stone walls, situated in a tranquil environment with a green lawn, trees, and the ambient sound of church bells.\n\nThe video shows a detailed view of an old gothic-style stone cathedral with large arched windows and a tall central tower, surrounded by a green lawn and a few bare trees, while bells are ringing in the background.", "time_sec": 52.938, "generation_time_seconds": 36.8305, "selection_time_seconds": 14.017, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2