{"id": "189", "question": "Describe what you see and hear in a single sentence.", "gt": "The cart with wheels is pushed through the room, creating a symphony of digital beeping, rapid vibrations, and humming on the hard wood floor.", "pred": "A toy wagon is in a room with a dog on the floor; a loud, abrupt mechanical sound is heard, possibly indicating an object or door movement.", "group_key": "AV Captioning", "sub_category": "AV Captioning", "dataset": "avhbench", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "A toy wagon is in a room with a dog on the floor; a loud, abrupt mechanical sound is heard, possibly indicating an object or door movement.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps are:\n1. Identify the visual elements: A toy wagon with wheels is in a room, a dog is lying on the floor, and there is a door or partition in the background.\n2. Analyze the audio elements: A loud engine or mechanical noise, likely from a vehicle or machinery, starts and stops abruptly.\n3. Cross-reference the visual and audio elements: The scene is indoors, and the abrupt mechanical noise could be a door closing or a device malfunctioning.\n4. Formulate a concise, dense description focusing on the main subjects and their interactions.\n5. Ensure the description adheres to the critical directives\nA toy wagon is in a room with a dog on the floor; a loud, abrupt mechanical sound is heard, possibly indicating an object or door movement.\nIdentify any specific details or anomalies in the audio or visual that could provide additional context or detail.\n\nA toy wagon is in a room with a dog on the floor; a loud, abrupt mechanical sound is heard, possibly indicating an object or door movement.", "time_sec": 57.755, "generation_time_seconds": 39.8625, "selection_time_seconds": 16.9063, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 510, 16, 13, 64547, 279, 9124, 5424, 25, 362, 21357, 60419, 448, 22696, 374, 304, 264, 